<a class="focus-ring text-[#626262] hover:text-[#202020] transition-colors py-5 text-[15px] font-normal" href="#">
            Waiting decisions
          </a>
<a aria-current="page" class="focus-ring text-[#202020] font-semibold text-[15px] border-b-2 border-[#A94B1D] py-5 inline-block" href="#">
